{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261021/photo/bkn-20261021085701008-1021_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261021115208\"/><p>盛珍閣有人墮樓亡。</p><p>天水圍有人墮樓。今日(21日)早上8時07分，天盛苑保安員報案，指一名女子懷疑由高處墮下昏迷倒臥盛珍閣對開行人路上。救護員接報趕至，經檢驗證實事主當場身亡，經初步調查相信，姓徐(78歲)老婦從上址一單位墮下，現場沒有檢獲遺書，死因有待驗屍後確定。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-21T04:20:35.816793+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":141,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-21T00:57:01+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-21T04:37:52.722645+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-21T04:18:05.951031+00:00","content_hash":"b39eb74012395274e2ce379f49a73bb85bb263a110cdb4acc603a8b8a79b41f6","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}